'''Bronze Vampire's Axe''' is an [[Trading|untradeable]] [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player who finished 3rd on the [[Halloween Event 2024]] Candy Collecting [[Leaderboards|Leaderboard]].

==Appearance==
Bronze Vampire’s Axe has the same appearance as [[Vampire's Axe]], but its primary colors were reverted to bronze.

== Trivia ==

* The sole owner of this trophy is [https://www.roblox.com/users/440019187/profile StreamSpeed].



